        },
        {
          "text": "Buce buyo, bapaizi basimutwe antoomwe abapati bacisi abalembi abasilubeta boonse bakoomekana, elyo bakaanga Jesu, bamutola baakumwaaba kuli-Pilato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
